      HACS, an add-on, a package or a download. A fork on GitHub that others can view, as
      allowed in section 1, is not distribution in itself;
   b. publish a modified version, or a dashboard derived from the Software, as a separate
      product or under another name;
   c. remove, disable, bypass or work around the license check, the free-plan limits or
      any other mechanism that controls access to the Pro features, or help others do so,
      including by publishing such changes in a fork;
   d. generate, share or sell license keys, or use a license key on more installations than
      it covers;
   e. remove or alter copyright notices or this license, or use the HomeDeck name and logo
      for anything other than referring to the Software.

